                 2) https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n0kmSftlesE

vault local url path - http://127.0.0.1:8200

Please find below few details about hashicorp and few commands related to that
 1. Download vault from here ->
  https://developer.hashicorp.com/vault/install
 2. Check version of vault
  a. Open cmd from downloaded vault.exe folder path and run command -> vault -version
 3. For starting vault server use below command
  a. vault server -dev
 4. Get value from vault
  a. vault kv get -mount=secret vaultdemo
 5. Put value into vault
  a. vault kv put -mount=secret vaultdemo demo.username=demouser

